WEBVTT

00:23.792 --> 00:28.022
The school is full of whispers The halls are full

00:28.062 --> 00:32.484
of filth They teach them things I'll never say

00:32.584 --> 00:35.986
They'll rot them all with guilt They talk about

00:37.107 --> 00:42.310
those bodies And the dirty things they do But I

00:42.370 --> 00:46.832
will never let that poison ever get to you

00:47.313 --> 00:52.896
INAPPROPRIATE! I check the box, I sign the line

00:52.916 --> 00:58.230
INAPPROPRIATE! Your mind will stay as pure as

00:58.330 --> 01:03.275
mine. You do not need to know those things,

01:03.375 --> 01:07.819
you'll never leave my sight. I'll keep you safe,

01:08.019 --> 01:12.263
I'll keep you clean, I'll keep you in the light.

01:17.743 --> 01:21.506
You're not like other children. You're fragile

01:21.706 --> 01:25.168
and you're small. You do not need those

01:25.288 --> 01:30.371
questions. You don't need them at all. Why talk

01:30.432 --> 01:35.815
about relations? Why talk about desire? It's

01:35.975 --> 01:39.978
just a fire for the weak. I'll protect you from

01:40.118 --> 01:45.620
that fire. Appropriate! I checked the box, I

01:45.680 --> 01:46.841
signed the line.

01:49.782 --> 01:55.426
You're my old state, as pure as vine. You do not

01:55.486 --> 01:59.108
need to know the things, you'll never leave my

01:59.208 --> 02:03.270
sight. I'll keep you safe, I'll keep you clean,

02:03.470 --> 02:06.272
I'll keep you in the light.

02:11.998 --> 02:18.863
Family life What bodies do They're changing

02:19.103 --> 02:27.650
forms The books they read The words they use

02:29.691 --> 02:30.612
It's all

02:45.449 --> 02:48.350
I check the box, I sign the line

02:51.351 --> 02:57.314
Your mind will stay as pure as mine You do not need

02:57.354 --> 03:01.295
to know those things You'll never leave my sight

03:01.976 --> 03:05.557
I'll keep you safe, I'll keep you clean I'll keep

03:05.617 --> 03:07.798
you in the light

03:17.347 --> 03:18.984
Inappropriate

